  <name>Control Center</name>
  <summary>Quick settings grid for the COSMIC panel</summary>
  <description>
    <p>A single panel button that opens the controls you actually reach for: Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, battery power profile, DNS profile, volume and brightness — laid out as a Quick-Settings-style grid with drill-down sub-menus.</p>
    <p>Every tile can be shown, hidden or reordered, custom launcher tiles can be added, and the popup follows the COSMIC theme, including accent colors and frosted-glass transparency.</p>
  </description>
